    "status": "NEEDS_REVIEW",
    "claimsToVerify": [
      "Big O describes asymptotic growth rather than exact execution time.",
      "Direct array indexing is commonly modeled as O(1).",
      "Traversing n elements once is O(n).",
      "Two complete nested traversals over n elements are O(n squared).",
      "Repeatedly halving a problem produces logarithmic growth.",
      "Traversing an array without allocating proportional additional storage can use O(1) auxiliary space."
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Keep Day 1 conceptual.",
